{"availability":"available","full":"Naatlant/courdeck","name":"courdeck","description":"Seasonal anime browser with a weekly broadcast schedule and Japanese streaming availability. Single HTML file, no dependencies.","category":"Other","language":"HTML","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-03T18:21:20Z","updated":"2026-10-07T22:54:45Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://naatlant.github.io/courdeck/","topics":["anilist","anime","anime-schedule","github-pages","justwatch","seasonal-anime","streaming","tmdb","vanilla-javascript","zero-dependency"],"demo":"https://naatlant.github.io/courdeck/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:26:10.454Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T18:26:10.454Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T18:26:10.454Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T18:26:10.454Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A single-file web app that collects seasonal anime from public APIs and shows them as a browsable list, a weekly broadcast schedule, and — the part you won't find in most anime trackers — where each title is actually streaming in Japan.","No build step, no framework, no API key required for visitors. The app itself is one HTML file you can open in a browser.","Note: the interface is available in English and Japanese (toggle in the top-right, or add ?lang=en / ?lang=ja to the URL). Streaming availability is Japan-only, which is the point — services like dAnime, U-NEXT and FOD rarely show up in international anime databases."],"features":["Responsive down to phone width, and follows the OS light/dark preference.","Seasonal list — this season in popularity order. The badges under each card are the part you won't find elsewhere: where the title is actually streaming in Japan.","Weekly schedule — a broadcast day starts at 5 a.m., so a 1:30 a.m. show is filed under the previous day and written 25:30, the way Japanese schedules do it.","Preview — banner art, score, streaming services and the next episode, without leaving the list. Hover with a mouse, Tab to it with a keyboard, or use the button on the card on a touch screen.","Favorites — a tab holding just the titles you starred. Export and import as a file, and export the next episodes to your calendar, all from here. Nothing leaves this browser."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Naatlant/courdeck/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a36f7fa01f5575e73d878b1c0a27782a1460a799303a197ca13bcbbb63092cdd","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T18:26:10.618Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:26:10.618Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A single-file web app that collects seasonal anime from public APIs and shows them as a browsable list, a weekly broadcast schedule, and — the part you won't find in most anime trackers — where each title is actually streaming in Japan.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Naatlant/courdeck/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"not_required","text":"No build step, no framework, no API key required for visitors.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Naatlant/courdeck/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"There are no accounts and no server.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Naatlant/courdeck/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"a36f7fa01f5575e73d878b1c0a27782a1460a799303a197ca13bcbbb63092cdd","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Naatlant/courdeck/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T18:26:10.619Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-07T22:54:45Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Naatlant/courdeck/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T18:26:10.620Z","hash":"a36f7fa01f5575e73d878b1c0a27782a1460a799303a197ca13bcbbb63092cdd","originalBytes":20190,"storedBytes":20190,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["data","streaming","title","tmdb","file","anilist","japanese","season","app","weekly","assets","only","scripts","api","github","next","year","